{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and Marco's First Argument", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Let's Make Up", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Around the World > Around the World", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and provide solutions to problems in a range of social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Expressing What is Necessary", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"strong\">had better</span> to say what you or another person needs to do. A short form for <span class=\"strong\">had better</span> is <span class=\"strong\">'d better</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ought to</span> take a look! <br> You<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'d better</span> watch closely.<br> I<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'d better</span> get cracking!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Apologizing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use different phrases to make and accept an apology.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You apologize when you know you have hurt someone's feelings.  There are polite and casual phrases to make and accept an apology.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making an Apology\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Accepting an Apology\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Polite\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pardon me for this ...</br> Please, forgive me for my ...</br> Please, accept my apologies for ...</br> Please, forgive me for ...</br> I'd like to apologize for ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I quite understand. </br>You couldn't help it.</br> That's all right.</br> Never mind. </br>Don't apologize.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Casual\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm so sorry for ... </br>I shouldn't have ...</br> It's all my fault. </br>I apologize for ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It doesn't matter.</br>Don't mention it. </br>That's OK. </br>Forget about it. </br>Don't worry about it. </br>No harm done.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ben</span>: I'm sorry for hurting your feelings. </br><span class=\"strong\">Cathy</span>: That's OK. Don't worry about it.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sincere", "type": "name"}, {"content": "honest; truthful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to show you how sincere my apology is.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are some of the words you use in the kitchen.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "chef's knives", "type": "name"}, {"content": "special knives for cooking", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I see you have a whole set of chef's knives.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "wok ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a special frying pan used for making stir-fry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I got a new wok!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "garlic press", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a tool used to crush garlic", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you like my new garlic press?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cutting board", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a special board used to cut bread, vegetables or other food", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Why don't you use my new cutting board?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "insulting", "type": "name"}, {"content": "hurting someone's feelings", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can be insulting sometimes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "creation ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that you make or create", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Come into my kitchen and start your creation!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of a recipe you know well. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain how to make it to your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include what kitchen tools you need.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try to use the structure \u201cgoing to have to/got to\u201d.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I explain how to make my famous creation to my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the tools I need to make it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about necessity. ", "type": "text"}], "ty